problem_statement:
Optimize: a ? 0 : 1 into +!a
### Describe the feature

Ternary expressions which resolve to 0 and 1 respectively, can be minified to `+!thing`/`+!!thing`.

Example:
```js
// input:
console.log(thing ? 1 : 0, thing ? 0 : 1)

// current output:
console.log(thing?1:0,thing?0:1);

// better output:
console.log(+!!thing,+!thing);
```

### Babel plugin or link to the feature description

_No response_

### Additional context

[Playground link](https://play.swc.rs/?version=1.10.7&code=H4sIAAAAAAAAA0vOzyvOz0nVy8lP1yjJyMxLV7BXMFSwUjDQUYBxDYBcQ00AIdd9JikAAAA%3D&config=H4sIAAAAAAAAA41VQY7bMAy85xWBz3toD1sUfUBvfYOgWJTDVJYMkcomWOTvpRV7N5tQQS9BPEOa5nAovW%2B22%2B5Affdr%2By5%2F5WGymSB%2FPAtC58j2JEgH%2FWipzzhx97KyB5opbwNBhS5XpmObB%2BCaRa9LeBdSIljDF2zEiP58W7BP45SB6AYTVN5XRog8w5wLvNxSOb0p%2BC6lADY%2BYYwlg5FhgKxE9SkEOxGYo9XpUdRCSlqFmSwMzkw5TSofHTKmKFI8sg6sM31yoFCYoWc8gpYmtSQtknT3VeZP2sGuDEMd8V02HG0olpWacKoDka995PYJiY0vmghXrqHAldSlRW8ycMlKvUPC2Mj6CyDtB0sU7Vj1uVegRnixUivbP83E6MWtfFZ4sbbWZIRBFDWIXpF1FgYyozbKDK70MOvat9lFhvtvIXRgwHvxiZJLb8j9XqvJ5wmSVwgZrtUauOKmtX8LPa9Cm%2F0tHbLqrCVgtLxvknQed0nboDUZeJ9cm5cRcGqyWQ6G09SkS3QghgCnRRTS8Hk52XAyoR6OD4aQlZAXmiGknXowTGLuOrrXBbt8nMSjjUNd%2B5tDk9MU4AihZej%2FWJanrHzwcfb3uuL3QQg%2FNX9aWUH8%2Fu3LxSGtbNbf2lQ3JlduGqr2vF4oP7rPoPX6WIXqkP6siTO2ufwDL9%2FWSOUGAAA%3D)

A bit of context: in our case, 0 and 1 are actually enums and this is parsing a boolean output to one. imagine:
```ts
enum State {
  ON,
  OFF,
  Indeterminate
}

function parseFromBool(x: boolean) {
  return x ? State.ON : State.OFF;
}
```

