@tronical 
> How are you rendering to the screen? 

My whole project code is [here](https://github.com/KortanZ/esp32c3-slint-st7735-demo), everything about slint is in [ui.rs](https://github.com/KortanZ/esp32c3-slint-st7735-demo/blob/main/src/ui.rs), the render loop looks like this:
```rust
