💅 Biome throw useExhaustiveDependencies error when useRef type is defined using type assertion
### Environment information

```bash
CLI:
  Version:                      1.5.2
  Color support:                true

Platform:
  CPU Architecture:             x86_64
  OS:                           linux

Environment:
  BIOME_LOG_DIR:                unset
