I'm using ESP32C3 and following the [Official MCU guide](https://releases.slint.dev/1.5.1/docs/rust/slint/docs/mcu/) to build a demo. It works but i encounter two problems.

My Cargo.toml slint part
``` toml
[dependencies.slint]
version = "1.5.1"
default-features = false
features = ["compat-1-2", "unsafe-single-threaded", "libm", "renderer-software"]
[build-dependencies]
slint-build = "1.5.1"
```

My `.slint` file
```slint
import { VerticalBox, Switch } from "std-widgets.slint";
export component Demo inherits Window{
